bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Register Page" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController
control AuthService

User -> UI: 1. Enter username, email, password\nAccept terms & submit
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /api/auth/register
activate Router

Router -> AuthController: 3. register(registerDto)
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthService: 4. register(registerDto)
activate AuthService

ref over AuthService: 3.1.b.i. Subsequence - Check duplicate email and username

AuthService -> AuthService: 5. Check username, email
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

alt Username already exists
    AuthService --> AuthController: 5.1.1. Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 5.1.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 5.1.3. Show error message
    UI --> User: 5.1.4. Username already exists
else Email already exists
    AuthService --> AuthController: 5.2.1. Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 5.2.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 5.2.3. Show error message
    UI --> User: 5.2.4. Email already exists
end

ref over AuthService: 3.1.b.ii. Subsequence - Hash password and create user

AuthService --> AuthController: 6. Return { success: true }
deactivate AuthService

AuthController --> Router: 7. HTTP 200 response
deactivate AuthController

Router --> UI: 8. Registration success
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 9. Show success message
deactivate UI
deactivate User